年第四款达成这一成绩的国产单机游戏，小团队的题材选择与发行节奏值得独立开发者借鉴。</description><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 03:44:24 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">543589e7ceba04354a280ffaba85a223a190dc91</guid><source url="http://www.gamelook.com.cn/2026/11/607201">GameLook</source></item><item><title>用三阶段 Python 干跑—灰度—应用管线与 3D 样条净空审计，杜绝 Unreal Engine 5 世界分区灾难</title><link>https://dev.to/juan_manuelrevillamaill/preventing-world-partition-disasters-in-unreal-engine-5-with-a-3-stage-python-dry-canary-apply-2gd4</link><description>作者在大型高山铁路地图上踩过批量改动的坑后，总结出一套先干跑、再灰度、最后应用的三阶段安全变异管线，配合可逆 JSON 备份与样条净空审计，让 UE5 世界分区的大规模编辑不再一失手就毁掉上千个 Actor。</description><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 03:59:48 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">d5eec6440f76a9c762674ee3bf3e25723034ed7d</guid><source url="https://dev.to/juan_manuelrevillamaill/preventing-world-partition-disasters-in-unreal-engine-5-with-a-3-stage-python-dry-canary-apply-2gd4">Dev.to 游戏开发</source></item><item><title>索尼无光盘未来几成定局：今年仅七款游戏实体销量破十万</title><link>https://dev.to/mango7777/sonys-disc-less-future-looks-inevitable-when-only-seven-games-hit-100k-physical-sales-all</link><description>Circana 数据显示今年全美仅七款 PlayStation 游戏实体销量超过十万份，实体渠道的萎缩速度比许多人预想的更快，独立开发者做实体发行决策时值得参考。</description><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 03:30:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">a44ffd8cc8f4a187ff8b7cf3698758ebcecacfa3</guid><source url="https://dev.to/mango7777/sonys-disc-less-future-looks-inevitable-when-only-seven-games-hit-100k-physical-sales-all">Dev.to 游戏开发</source></item><item><title>我们如何用马尔可夫状态、Aho-Corasick 与 CoALA 把 LLM Token 成本砍掉 90%</title><link>https://dev.to/nikhil2bhardwaj/how-we-slashed-llm-token-cost-by-90-with-markov-states-aho-corasick-coala-2pjd</link><description>针对越写越慢越贵的 AI 写作与 RPG 工具，分享一套把长对话 Token 成本压下来的状态机方案。</description><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 05:47:24 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">f86a67c09721517802c77742e100410356b51e59</guid><source url="https://dev.to/nikhil2bhardwaj/how-we-slashed-llm-token-cost-by-90-with-markov-states-aho-corasick-coala-2pjd">Dev.to 游戏开发</source></item><item><title>为什么日文只在打包后的 UE5 版本里变成方块字</title><link>https://dev.to/sasakidevtools/why-japanese-text-turns-into-tofu-boxes-only-in-packaged-unreal-engine-5-builds-91c</link><description>编辑器里正常显示的日文，打包后却变成方块字，一位日本独立开发者追踪了这个字体问题的根源。</description><pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 08:20:48 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">1c236721185f7b742e5dcfb9745210787d6adbb8</guid><source url="https://dev.to/sasakidevtools/why-japanese-text-turns-into-tofu-boxes-only-in-packaged-unreal-engine-5-builds-91c">Dev.to 游戏开发</source></item><item><title>小米做的概念超跑，为什么要在游戏里寻求真实感</title><link>https://www.yystv.cn/p/14671</link><description>对话小米汽车设计负责人，聊小米概念超跑如何借《跑车浪漫旅 7》的 Vision GT 企划在游戏中追求真实感，跨界合作的思路对做载具与品牌联动的开发者有参考价值。</description><pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 10:00:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">bdfded30f687c943adc4609f63854c77163f2dbd</guid><source url="https://www.yystv.cn/p/14671">游研社</source></item><item><title>如何写一份外包美术真正会照着做的游戏美术风格指南</title><link>https://dev.to/juegostudiosofficial/writing-a-game-art-style-guide-that-outsourced-artists-will-actually-follow-64p</link><description>一份美术风格指南好不好用，不看它有多精美，而看它能不能在外包画师赶工时直接回答问题，这篇分享了让指南真正落地的结构与维护方法。</description><pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 10:46:36 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">3ca18397ab46bca6bf151aaf59e5e430bd9ef843</guid><source url="https://dev.to/juegostudiosofficial/writing-a-game-art-style-guide-that-outsourced-artists-will-actually-follow-64p">Dev.to 游戏开发</source></item><item><title>Epic 将在虚幻引擎 6 中移除蓝图，AI 将协助迁移</title><link>https://www.pocketgamer.biz/epic-games-to-drop-blueprints-from-unreal-engine-6-as-ai-reshapes-migration-plans</link><description>Epic 确认虚幻引擎 6 将不再支持蓝图可视化脚本与 Actor Gameplay Framework，并表示 AI 会帮助开发者过渡到替代方案。</description><pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 11:35:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">a6fc0d1ba0b7aaec50b7aa619b3ae8b75f408525</guid><source url="https://www.pocketgamer.biz/epic-games-to-drop-blueprints-from-unreal-engine-6-as-ai-reshapes-migration-plans">PocketGamer.biz</source><